29. Kotzebue's average high has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.37\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.18 to +0.56), about +3.6\u00b0F since 1929.","t_mon":"Lows rose in 11 of 12 months. Highs rose in 5 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Kotzebue has gotten wetter","p_rain":"Kotzebue's yearly precipitation has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.57 inches per decade</strong> (95% range +0.35 to +0.79), about +4.6 inches since 1944. The 1991\u20132020 normal is 11.3 inches a year. The wettest year was 2023 (17.48 in); the driest, 1969 (5.07 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 4 daily record highs, 2 daily record lows"}}